        {
            "title": "Get Free: Simple Story - Alex (Limited Time)",
            "date": "2020-03-24 20:44:14",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2984138620239317325",
            "content": "Covid-19 is raging in the world. And so many countries are in quarantine. People are sitting at home, someone is sick, someone has lost his job. All this is very sad and incomprehensible when it all ends. I decided to make one of my games free for a small amount of time and at the same time encourage other developers to do the same. Yes, we will lose some sales, but people will be able to stay at home and play games. If each developer makes at least one game free, then people can replenish the library with a rather large collection.\r\n\r\nMay God protect you all. Do not be ill. Your Creative."
        },
